stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Unregistered
    Unregistered --> v1_blank : push, with SPARROW_AUTO_REGISTER_EVENTS on
    Unregistered --> v1 : register or import with a schema
    v1_blank --> v1 : first schema added (fill-in, stays v1)
    v1 --> v2 : compatible schema change
    v2 --> v3 : breaking change, applied with allow_breaking
    v3 --> v3_inactive : deactivate (active=false, same version)
    v3_inactive --> v3 : reactivate
    note right of v3 : Every version is kept. Each event records the version it was accepted under. Event types are never deleted.
